WEBVTT

00:12:57.185 --> 00:13:00.386
oduzima život celog čovečanstva.

00:13:00.386 --> 00:13:07.582
Svako ko spasi jedan život,
spasava život celog čovečanstva."

00:13:07.582 --> 00:13:10.652
I posvetio bi se potpuno

00:13:10.652 --> 00:13:17.672
teškom i trnovitom procesu
pomirenja.

00:13:17.672 --> 00:13:19.107
Hvala vam.

00:13:19.107 --> 00:13:23.506
(Aplauz)

00:13:23.506 --> 00:13:27.506
Hvala.
(Aplauz)